{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Villains attack the Slime Nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crush them to save it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SRUSH: 2D roguelike pull-action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pull and shoot slimes with your mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smash villains to defend your nest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game over if they reach it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Clear all waves to win!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mouse-only controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Easy Pull Action!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot slimes at enemies with your mouse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Villains spawn each wave and approach the nest. Stop them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/\u30b9\u30c8\u30a2_\u64cd\u4f5c.gif?t=1750209655\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Power Up Slimes!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade stats and skills to boost slimes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/\u30b9\u30c8\u30a2_\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7_EN.gif?t=1750209655\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Epic Builds!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build strong slimes to crush enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808630/extras/\u30b9\u30c8\u30a2_\u30d3\u30eb\u30c9.gif?t=1750209655\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Endless Replay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock skills and 6 characters with 5 difficulty levels for tons of fun!</p>","back